+# Citizen Proposals Removal — Deploy Notes
+
+This file tracks the three-deploy removal of citizen proposals (`Proposal`,
+`ProposalNotification`, author dashboard `Dashboard::*`) as requested by the
+council. Legislation proposals (`Legislation::Proposal`) stay.
+
+Read this file first at the start of every session. The assistant does not
+remember previous sessions.
+
+Hosting constraints (all deploys):
+
+- No downtime: new release deploys and migrates while previous release servers
+  keep serving. Every deploy must run safely next to the one before it.
+- Nothing leaves the database without a copy: before a table or column is
+  dropped, dump what it holds into a file under `db/` and keep it.
+- Change nothing unrelated to citizen proposals.
+- We ship English and Spanish. The `i18n` spec (`spec/i18n_spec.rb`,
+  `locales: [en]`) keeps English honest. Translators catch up on Spanish later,
+  so Spanish files are left untouched in deploy 1.
+
+Plan (from hosting):
+
+1. Deploy 1 — code goes (no DB drops, no dumps needed).
+2. Deploy 2 — tables and columns go (with dumps under `db/`).
+3. Deploy 3 — tidies up whatever is left.
+
+---
+
+## Deploy 1 — PREPARED (not yet shipped)
+
+Goal: remove citizen-proposal code while leaving all tables/columns in place
+so old servers keep working during the deploy. No migrations, no `schema.rb`
+changes, no dumps (nothing leaves the DB yet).
+
+### Deleted (citizen-proposal-only files, legislation kept)
+
+Models / GraphQL:
+
+- `app/models/proposal.rb`, `app/models/proposal_notification.rb`,
+  `app/models/proposal/` (`exporter.rb`), `app/models/dashboard.rb`,
+  `app/models/dashboard/` (`action.rb`, `administrator_task.rb`,
+  `executed_action.rb`)
+- `app/graphql/types/proposal_type.rb`,
+  `app/graphql/types/proposal_notification_type.rb`
+
+Controllers:
+
+- `app/controllers/proposals_controller.rb`,
+  `app/controllers/proposal_notifications_controller.rb`,
+  `app/controllers/dashboard_controller.rb`, `app/controllers/dashboard/`,
+  `app/controllers/concerns/dashboard/`
+- `app/controllers/admin/proposals_controller.rb`,
+  `app/controllers/admin/hidden_proposals_controller.rb`,
+  `app/controllers/admin/hidden_proposal_notifications_controller.rb`,
+  `app/controllers/admin/proposal_milestones_controller.rb`,
+  `app/controllers/admin/proposal_progress_bars_controller.rb`,
+  `app/controllers/admin/dashboard/` (kept generic
+  `app/controllers/admin/dashboard_controller.rb`)
+- `app/controllers/management/proposals_controller.rb`,
+  `app/controllers/moderation/proposals_controller.rb`,
+  `app/controllers/moderation/proposal_notifications_controller.rb`
+  (kept `moderation/legislation/proposals_controller.rb`,
+  `admin/legislation/proposals_controller.rb`,
+  `legislation/proposals_controller.rb`)
+
+Helpers / components / mailers / lib:
+
+- `app/helpers/proposals_helper.rb`,
+  `app/helpers/proposals_dashboard_helper.rb`,
+  `app/helpers/admin/proposal_dashboard_actions_helper.rb`
+- `app/components/proposals/`, `app/components/admin/proposals/`,
+  `app/components/admin/settings/proposals_dashboard_tab_component.*`,
+  `app/components/admin/dashboard/actions/`,
+  `app/components/dashboard/`,
+  `app/components/widget/feeds/proposal_component.*`
+  (kept `app/components/admin/dashboard/index_component.*` generic)
+- `app/mailers/dashboard/mailer.rb`, `app/lib/email_digest.rb`
+
+Views:
+
+- `app/views/proposals/`, `app/views/proposal_notifications/`,
+  `app/views/dashboard/`, `app/views/layouts/dashboard.html.erb`,
+  `app/views/layouts/dashboard/`
+- `app/views/admin/proposals/`, `app/views/admin/hidden_proposals/`,
+  `app/views/admin/hidden_proposal_notifications/`,
+  `app/views/admin/dashboard/actions/`,
+  `app/views/admin/dashboard/administrator_tasks/`
+  (kept `app/views/admin/dashboard/index.html.erb` generic)
